      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe MSRTSS was implemented in the Graphite native Vulkan without dynamic rendering [here](https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/991857) so presumably it should work on Pixel 7/8. @syoussefi@chromium.org might have some idea what is wrong here.",
